{
  "bookId": "hero-213203",
  "id": "bond-28526",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "28526001",
          "sourceType": 9,
          "text": "这天，正打算把购买的「手办屋」送给绯野原爱小姐。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28526002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "锵——Surprise！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28526003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好吧，一点都不意外。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28526004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "提前进入这间屋子，怪盗小姐也许有一千种方法。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28526005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "但你怎么会知道，在万千商品中，我会购买这一件？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28526006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "这难道不是侦探们的工作吗。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28526007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那就把屋子送给凛小姐了哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28526008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "然后，又一次正中我的下怀？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28526009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "可恶！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28526010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "哈哈，骗你的！\n一位顶尖的怪盗，首先是一位顶尖的心理师。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28526011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "心理……师？我知道了……手法是「心理暗示」？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28526012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "人类会被周遭环境同化，进而做出无意识判断。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28526013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "在你活动的区域，我摆放了一些不太引起警觉、但总能吸引视线的东西。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28526014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "比如这间玩具屋的海报，模型图纸，广告以及各种商品信息。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28526015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "太狡猾了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28526016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "比起这个，怪盗小姐「精心挑选」的屋子，不好奇里面还准备了什么好东西吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28526017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这是那个时候的……契约书？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28526018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "上面多了什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28526019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "英文短句，我的指纹——被你骗上去的！还有……小红点？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28526020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "那可是怪盗大人的手印。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28526021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "现在，这份契约书终于完整了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "28526022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绯野原爱",
          "text": "我喜欢完整的东西，就像房子、契约，还有我跟你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
